Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:19:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] workspace_source v2: keep protocol-1 worktree artifacts on
 the legacy path

Selection staging (completion/review/heartbeat artifacts) now requires a
source protocol 2 run. v1 worktree cards on source-enabled hosts keep
ordinary attachment preservation: no snapshot scan, no selection, no v2
artifact manifest. Review t_bf76ffa883c01289.
